#: index.docbook:690
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allows to set the size of the font (from 6 to 72)."
msgstr "Permite escoller o tamaño das letras (entre 6 e 72)."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:694
#, no-c-format
