#, no-c-format
msgid "&help.menu.documentation;"
msgstr "&help.menu.documentation;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:962
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced Editing"
msgstr "Edición Avanzada"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:965
#, no-c-format
msgid "Name insertion"
msgstr "Inserzón de nomes"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:966
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A special feature is the name insertion. The blue square you type into is "
"actual a list. Furthermore, that list can contain other lists. When you type "
"a backslash (<literal>\\</literal>) you get a new empty list right away. But "
"this one is special. It uses a different font and is meant to insert things "
"like function names. There is, however, a second idea here. Your keyboard "
"only has a limited number of keys. The wealth of mathematical symbols on the "
"other side is overwhelming. To get one of those you can type its name and "
"press the space bar afterwards. The name you typed will be replaced by the "
"symbol then. In this context, the <keycap>Space</keycap> bar means "
"<quote>get out of here</quote>, that is move the cursor to the containing "
"list. The cursor will be positioned at the end of what you just entered but "
"will also enclose part of the original formula, after pressing the space bar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:982
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another thing you might want to insert are spaces. We all know, printing "
"formulae is all about the right spacing. And you can do just that using a "
"<quote>name list</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Outra cousa que pode querer inserir son espazos. Todos sabemos que imprimir "
"fórmulas consiste en dar os espazos correctos. E iso é o que pode facer "
"mediante unha <quote>lista de nomes</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:985
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Inside the blue square do: <userinput><keycombo action=\"seq\"><keycap>\\</"
"keycap><keycap>,</keycap><keycap>SPACE</keycap></keycombo></userinput> to "
"get a small space."
msgstr ""
"Dentro do cadro azul escreba <userinput><keycombo action=\"seq\"><keycap>\\</"
"keycap><keycap>,</keycap><keycap>ESPAZO</keycap></keycombo></userinput> para "
"obter un espazo pequeno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:989
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Do: <userinput><keycombo action=\"seq\"><keycap>\\</keycap><keycap>&lt;</"
"keycap><keycap>Space</keycap></keycombo></userinput> to get a medium space."
msgstr ""
"Escreba: <userinput><keycombo action=\"seq\"><keycap>\\</keycap><keycap>&lt;"
"</keycap> <keycap>Espazo</keycap></keycombo></userinput> para un espazo "
"mediano."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:993
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Do: <userinput><keycombo action=\"seq\"><keycap>\\</keycap><keycap>;</"
"keycap><keycap>Space</keycap></keycombo></userinput> to get a thick space."
msgstr ""
"Escreba: <userinput><keycombo action=\"seq\"><keycap>\\</keycap><keycap>;</"
"keycap> <keycap>Espazo</keycap></keycombo></userinput> para obter un espazo "
"longo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:997
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Do: <userinput><keycap>\\</keycap> quad <keycap>Space</keycap></userinput> "
"to get a quadruple wide space."
msgstr ""
"Escreba: <userinput><keycap>\\</keycap> quad <keycap>Espazo</keycap></"
"userinput> para obter un espazo de lonxitude cuádrupla."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1001
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the same way, specific mathematical symbols can be inserted. "
"<userinput><keycap>\\</keycap> oint <keycap>Space</keycap></userinput> "
"inserts the path integral about a closed contour. Below is the result of "
"<userinput><keycap>\\</keycap> oint <keycap>Space</keycap></userinput>:"
msgstr ""
"Do mesmo xeito pode inserir símbolos matemáticos específicos. "
"<userinput><keycap>\\</keycap> oint <keycap>Espazo</keycap></userinput> "
"insere a integral dunha traxectoria arredor dun contorno pechado. Embaixo "
"móstrase o resultado de <userinput><keycap>\\</keycap> oint <keycap>Espazo</"
"keycap></userinput>:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1007
#, no-c-format
msgid "Picture of path integral"
msgstr "Imaxe da integral de traxectoria"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1017
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing Formulas"
msgstr "Edición de Fórmulas"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1019
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <menuchoice> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Edit Formula String</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice> allows the user to edit the <acronym>ASCII</"
"acronym> formulas that have been copied from other applications, such as "
"<ulink url=\"http://scilabsoft.inria.fr/\">Scilab</ulink>, and transform "
"them directly into mathematical type. An example will make this clear. Below "
"is a screenshot of <literal>INRIA</literal> Scilab."
msgstr ""
"Mediante <menuchoice><guimenu>Editar</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Editar Cadea da "
"Fórmula</guimenuitem></menuchoice> poderá editar as fórmulas <acronym>ASCII</"
"acronym> que copie de outras aplicacións, como <ulink url=\"http://"
"scilabsoft.inria.fr/\">Scilab</ulink>, e transformá-las directamente a "
"símbolos matemáticos. En baixo móstrase unha captura de pantalla de "
"<literal>INRIA</literal> Scilab."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1027
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scilab picture"
msgstr "Imaxe de Scilab"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1034
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Copy and paste the text beginning with <literal>x*sin(30*x)</literal> into "
"the formula editor as shown below:"
msgstr ""
"Copie e apegue o texto que comeza con <literal>x*sin(30*x)</literal> no "
"editor de fórmulas como se mostra en baixo:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1038
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scilab formula edit picture"
msgstr "Imaxe de edición dunha fórmula de Scilab"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1046
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you click on <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, the editor will complain about "
"aborted parsing. It cannot recognize one of the symbols in the formula. The "
"displayed formula would show that the Pi symbol is not correctly rendered. "
"This means that the <literal>%</literal> must be deleted. Do this and "
"&kformula; will render the mathematical font properly, as shown below."
msgstr ""
"Se preme en <guibutton>Aceptar</guibutton>, o editor protestará por un erro "
"de procesamento. Non pode recoñecer un dos símbolos na fórmula. Na fórmula "
"que se mostra vese que o símbolo Pi non está correcto. Isto significa que "
"debe borra o <literal>%</literal>. Faga isto e &kformula; mostrará o símbolo "
"matemático correctamente, como se mostra en baixo."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1052
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scilab formula rendered in &kformula;"
msgstr "Fórmula de Scilab mostrada en &kformula;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1060
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The formula editor will accept most C language mathematical expressions, "
"like the formulas from a Runge-Kutta program below:"
msgstr ""
"O editor de fórmulas aceitará a maioría das expresións matemáticas da "
"linguaxe C, como as dun programa de Runge-Kutta:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:1062
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<function>void derives(float x, float y[], float dydx[])\n"
"{\n"
" dydx[1] = y[2];\n"
" dydx[2] = -0.8*x*y[2] - sin(x)*y[1];\n"
"}</function>"
msgstr ""
"<function>void derives(float x, float y[], float dydx[])\n"
"{\n"
" dydx[1] = y[2];\n"
" dydx[2] = -0.8*x*y[2] - sin(x)*y[1];\n"
"}</function>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1064
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here <literal>dydx[1]</literal> is the first order derivative and "
"<literal>dydx[2]</literal> is the second order derivative. After copying the "
"formula, you will have to edit the derivatives with &kformula;. Here is how "
"it is done. First copy and paste the bottom expression into the formula "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"Aquí <literal>dydx[1]</literal> é a derivada de primeira orden e "
"<literal>dydx[2]</literal> é a de segunda orden. Tras copiar a fórmula terá "
"que editar as derivadas con &kformula;. Isto faise así. Primeiro copie e "
"apegue a expresión do fondo no editor de fórmulas."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1069
#, no-c-format
msgid "Runge-Kutta in editor;"
msgstr "Runge-Kutta no editor;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1077
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next remove the <literal>[ ]</literal>, leaving just y's."
msgstr "A seguir borre o <literal>[ ]</literal>, deixando só os y."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1080
#, no-c-format
msgid "Runge-Kutta edited"
msgstr "Runge-Kutta editado"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1088
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now click <guibutton>OK</guibutton> and place the cursor by a <literal>y</"
"literal> and delete it. Insert the appropriate symbols as shown below."
msgstr ""
"Agora prema en <guibutton>Aceptar</guibutton> e sitúe o cursor nun "
"<literal>y</literal> e borre-o. Insira os símbolos apropriados como se "
"mostra en baixo."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1092
#, no-c-format
msgid "Runge-Kutta in &kformula;"
msgstr "Runge-Kutta en &kformula;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Not every expression that &kformula; is capable of translates into a valid C "
"expression. For example the superscript expression:"
msgstr ""
"Non todas as expresións que poda mostrar en &kformula; son traducíbeis nunha "
"expresión de C válida. Por exemplo o superíndice:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Superscript in &kformula;"
msgstr "O superíndice en &kformula;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"is displayed as <literal>()**()</literal>, which is not a valid C statement "
"for exponentiation. Similarly the 1 by 2 matrix displays as <literal>()/()</"
"literal>. This is not a valid array in C."
msgstr ""
"é mostrado como <literal>()**()</literal>, que non é unha sentenza válida de "
"C para a exponenciación. De xeito similar a matriz de 1x2 móstrase como "
"<literal>()/()</literal>. Isto non é un vector válido en C."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Definite Integrals and Indices"
msgstr "Integrais definidas e Índices"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Definite Integrals"
msgstr "Integrais Definidas"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A definite integral is made by using <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;"
"<keycap>U</keycap></keycombo> for the upper limit of integration and "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>L</keycap></keycombo> for the lower "
"limit of integration."
msgstr ""
"As integrais definidas introdúcense usando <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;"
"<keycap>U</keycap> </keycombo> para o límite superior e <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>L</keycap> </keycombo> para o inferior."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1128
#, no-c-format
msgid "definite integral"
msgstr "integral definida"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Reposition the cursor in front of the integral after making the first of the "
"limits."
msgstr ""
"Reposición do cursor para a fronte da integral tras inserir o primeiro dos "
"límites."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Positioning Indices"
msgstr "Posicionando os Índices"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1141
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The upper or lower index can be positioned by highlighting the desired text. "
"In this example, an arrow is needed above the P, in dP. Using <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>U</keycap></keycombo> places the desired "
"vector symbol in the wrong place; namely above the <quote>d</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Os índices superiores ou inferiores poden ser posicionados realzando o texto "
"excollido. Neste exemplo, precísase unha frecha sobre o P, en dP. Se "
"usa<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>U</keycap></keycombo> situará o "
"símbolo de vector no lugar errado; sobre o <quote>d</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The problem is solved by highlighting only the P in "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"index_smear.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject> and then entering "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>U</keycap></keycombo>. Here is the "
"correct result."
msgstr ""
"O problema arránxase realzando só o P en <inlinemediaobject><imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"index_smear.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></"
"inlinemediaobject> e inserindo <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>U</"
"keycap></keycombo>. Este é o resultado correcto."

